Most people will suggest Valkyries, but picking the actual numbers
from NAO apart indicates the relative difficultiy of roles is rounding
error compared to player spoiledness and player skill. If you just
want a solution for yourself, I'd suggest studying "yet another
nethack site" and nethack.wikia.com.

However, if you want to write a patch, go ahead. Currently visible
development seems to take part mostly in the variants, so you might
want to take a look at sporkhack, slashem and unnethack and/or keep
your code compatible. In particular, their respective maintainers are
much more qualified than I am to comment on game balance issues. One
idea might be to make the game more self-explanatory (instead of
easier), so newbies can play instead of studying.


